{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Remove the obsolete missing-model warning.** This still describes an uncompilable draft, contradicting the updated POM and propagation guide, which identify AWS SDK 2.56.0 as providing the typed setter. Readers are incorrectly told that the declared dependencies cannot build this feature. State the configured model requirement and distinguish it from the remaining deployed-backend validation.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-6NVI","finding_digest":"74a276a5370ce03f94c5011454e645441cd9ccfceac551f13aecb08c1b7968c0","finding_id":"arf_v1_osrhnjjxbtqd7fgfaekfjzsfiq","finding_key":"otel-plugin/readme.md::chained-invoke-propagation::model-support-accuracy","identity_key":"otel-plugin/readme.md::chained-invoke-propagation::model-support-accuracy","line":128,"observation_digest":"ce7631e077787a177a0198c75a98d7a7ec59e5c0051dc659a8d317a6b20e8867","observation_id":"aro_v1_zz3ddydxpb5bo6qbtddvvggxu7","path":"otel-plugin/README.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T21:53:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_26omgkeb6svaivwj5qzsoewlet","reviewed_base_sha":"f49beb68ba6c5d9970622d638fb15a2a38c63041","reviewed_head_sha":"ea7469911a8b4612f51ced2bee1684fd4577f07c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_rcyigfmdpwcnvbwdlzrhpi734z"},"pull_request":{"number":768},"record_id":"art_v1_f3uvobxb4p3ird4s5g5dzwpi7a","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T21:53:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
